<title>JAPAN: Tokai Aluminum Foil - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokai Aluminum Foil - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.64		vs	    8.07</p>
<p> Operating     loss 2 million	 vs   loss 133 million</p>
<p> Current	loss 64 million	 vs   loss 271 million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 74 million	 vs   loss 280 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 1.68 yen	  vs     loss 6.34 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     44 million	  vs	  44 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokai Aluminum Foil Co Ltd is a manufacturer of aluminium foils.</p>
</text>
